@startuml M6-Document-State-Machine

' Document lifecycle state machine: complete journey from discovery to search results
' Phase 1 (SEED->CRAWL): Download from GitHub API with retry logic on failures
' Phase 2 (INDEX): Text processing pipeline (tokenize, normalize, stem, n-grams)
' Phase 3 (STATS): Calculate term frequencies (TF) and inverse document frequencies (IDF)
' Phase 4 (PAGERANK): Iterative PageRank computation for document importance ranking
' Phase 5 (QUERYABLE): Document ready for user searches; calculate scores when matched
' Final: TF-IDF + metadata boosts combined (75% relevance + 25% popularity)

!define BGCOLOR #F5F5F5
skinparam backgroundColor BGCOLOR
skinparam stateBorderColor #333
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam arrowColor #333
skinparam startBorderColor #333
skinparam endBorderColor #333
skinparam endBackgroundColor #FF9999
skinparam shadowing false

title M6 Document State Machine - Lifecycle

[*] --> SEED : Repository in\nseed file

SEED --> QUEUED_CRAWL : Add to frontier
note on link
  Frontier manager
  initializes entry
end note

QUEUED_CRAWL --> CRAWLING : Worker picks\nfrom frontier
CRAWLING --> CRAWL_SUCCESS : README\ndownloaded\nsuccessfully
note on link
  GitHub API fetch
  stores to KV store
end note

CRAWLING --> CRAWL_FAILED : Network error\nor not found
CRAWL_FAILED --> QUEUED_CRAWL : Retry with\nbackoff
note on link
  Max retries=3
  Exponential backoff
end note

CRAWL_FAILED --> CRAWL_SKIPPED : Max retries\nexceeded
CRAWL_SKIPPED --> [*]

CRAWL_SUCCESS --> CRAWL_DEDUP : Check seen\nrepos tracker
CRAWL_DEDUP --> CRAWL_CACHED : Already\nindexed\nbefore
note on link
  Avoid re-indexing
  same content
end note

CRAWL_CACHED --> [*]

CRAWL_DEDUP --> CRAWL_STORED : Mark as seen\nStore content
CRAWL_STORED --> INDEXED_PENDING : Ready for\nindexing

INDEXED_PENDING --> INDEXING : MapReduce\nterm extraction\njob runs

INDEXING --> TOKENIZING : Tokenize\ntext
TOKENIZING --> NORMALIZING : Lowercase\nremove special chars
NORMALIZING --> STEMMING : Porter\nStemmer
STEMMING --> NGRAM_BUILDING : Generate\nn-grams

NGRAM_BUILDING --> TERM_COUNTING : Count term\nfrequencies
TERM_COUNTING --> INDEX_UPDATED : Inverted index\nupdated
note on link
  term->[docs]
  posting lists
end note

INDEX_UPDATED --> STATS_UPDATED : TF/DF\nstatistics\nupdated
STATS_UPDATED --> PAGERANK_ITER : PageRank\niterative job\nruns (doc as node)

PAGERANK_ITER --> PAGERANK_CONVERGENCE : Converge after\nN iterations
PAGERANK_CONVERGENCE --> FULLY_INDEXED : Document fully\nindexed

FULLY_INDEXED --> QUERYABLE : Ready for\nuser queries

QUERYABLE --> QUERY_HIT : User query\nmatches\nthis doc
note on link
  Term lookup
  in inverted index
end note

QUERYABLE --> QUERY_MISS : User query\ndoesn't\nmatch
QUERY_MISS --> QUERYABLE : Wait next\nquery

QUERY_HIT --> SCORING : Calculate\nTF-IDF score
SCORING --> METADATA_BOOST : Apply metadata\nboost\n(stars, lang, topics)
METADATA_BOOST --> FINAL_SCORE : Combine scores\n0.75*TFIDF +\n0.25*boost
FINAL_SCORE --> RANKING : Rank among\nresults

RANKING --> TOP_K : In top 10\nresults?
TOP_K --> DISPLAYED : Show to\nuser
DISPLAYED --> QUERYABLE : Searchable\nagain

RANKING --> NOT_SHOWN : Below\nthreshold
NOT_SHOWN --> QUERYABLE : Searchable\nstill available

note right of SEED
  Repository identified
  from seed file
end note

note right of CRAWLING
  Download from GitHub
  fetch README + metadata
end note

note right of INDEXING
  Term extraction &
  statistics phase
  (MapReduce Job 1-2)
end note

note right of PAGERANK_ITER
  PageRank computation
  (MapReduce Job 3)
  iterative convergence
end note

note right of QUERYABLE
  Document ready for searches
  All indexing complete
  Scores cached
end note

note right of FINAL_SCORE
  Score = 75% information retrieval
        + 25% popularity/metadata
end note

@enduml
